# Title: Service Started/Stopped Via Wmic.EXE
# ID: 0b7163dc-7eee-4960-af17-c0cd517f92da
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-06-20
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047
# Description: Detects usage of wmic to start or stop a service
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:* service * AND process.command_line:* call *) AND (process.command_line:*stopservice* OR process.command_line:*startservice*)) AND ((process.pe.original_file_name:"wmic.exe") OR (process.executable:*\\WMIC.exe)))
